      "severity": "low",
      "target_agent": "SceneDesignerAgent"
    },
    {
      "issue": "Natural biome trees at the edges of the stone platform could confuse the agent about which tree to interact with, though the sandbox showed the placed spruce tree is distinctive on the stone ground.",
